Whether validation may show yet (\fB:user\-invalid\fR). Default \fBtrue\fR: a bad date shows its error ring at once. Inside a \fBField\fR pass the field's \fBInteraction::revealed\fR so a pristine field stays quiet and the Field draws the one ring.
