.B \&.on_view(f: impl Fn(Date) \-> M + 'a)
The previous / next month button was pressed; gets the first day of the new month. This is the month\-level compatibility path: it is called only while the calendar shows months, and the title and level are not navigable. Use \fBon_nav\fR for the levels (it takes precedence).
